error[E0082]: module-level 'let' cannot hold 'Slot': only untraced types may live at module scope in a runtime/ module
 --> rtmodulesupport/runtime/cell/cell.bit:8:12
  |
8 | export let slot: Slot = Slot{ n = 1 }
  |            ^^^^ this cell is not scanned by the collector, so it may hold integers, floats, bools, raw '*T' pointers, or fixed arrays of those — but never a reference (§11.11)
error[E0082]: module-level array 'let' cannot have an initializer
 --> rtmodulesupport/runtime/cell/cell.bit:9:12
  |
9 | export let heads: [4]int = [4]int{ 1, 2, 3, 4 }
  |            ^^^^^ a module-level array is zero-valued; assign its elements at run time
error[E0064]: module-level 'let' initializer must be a compile-time constant expression
  --> rtmodulesupport/runtime/cell/cell.bit:10:25
   |
10 | export let count: int = compute()
   |                         ^^^^^^^^^ module state is emitted as a static byte image, so there is no run-time initializer
